{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08271","headline":"赠张公洲革处士 · 李白","name":"赠张公洲革处士","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"列子居郑圃，不将衆庶分。\n革侯遁南浦，常恐楚人闻。\n抱瓮灌秋蔬，心闲游天云。\n每将瓜田叟，耕种汉水濆。\n时登张公洲，入兽不乱羣。\n井无桔槔事，门绝刺绣文。\n长揖二千石，远辞百里君。\n斯爲真隐者，吾党慕清芬。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_08271.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08271","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}